      {
        "id": "method",
        "title": "Методические материалы",
        "text": "<div><strong>Перечень рекомендуемой литературы </strong></div><div><br></div><div>Основным источником, вдохновившем данный цикл лекций является монография <em>Schubert, U. S. An introduction to redox polymers for energy-storage applications / U. S. Schubert, G. R. Newkome, A. Winter. – Weinheim, Germany : Wiley-VCH, 2023. – 537 с.</em> </div><div><br></div><div>Достаточно фундаментальными источниками.  Bard, A. J. Electrochemical methods: fundamentals and applications. Electrochemical methods / A. J. Bard, L. R. Faulkner, H. S. White. – Third edition-е изд. – Hoboken, NJ : Wiley, 2022.\n4.  Electropolymerization: Concepts, Materials and Applications. Electropolymerization / ed. by S. Cosnier, A. Karyakin. – 1th ed. – Wiley, 2010.\n5.  Handbook of conducting polymers. Conjugated polymers: processing and applications. Handbook of conducting polymers. Conjugated polymers / ed. T.A.Skotheim, J.R. Reynolds. – 3rd ed. – Boca Raton : CRC Press, 2007. – 1 с.\n6.  Handbook of conducting polymers. Conjugated polymers: theory, synthesis, properties, and characterization. Handbook of conducting polymers. Conjugated polymers / ed. T. A. Skotheim, J. R. Reynolds. – 3rd ed. – Boca Raton : CRC Press, 2007. – 1 с.</div>"
      }
    ],
